[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}, scale=0.55]
\draw[->] (-7.5,0) -- (4.5,0) node[right] {$x$};
\draw[->] (0,-5.5) -- (0,2.2) node[above] {$y$};
\foreach \x in {-7,...,-1} {\draw (\x,0.15) -- (\x,-0.15); \node[below,font=\scriptsize] at (\x,-0.15) {$\x$};}
\foreach \x in {1,...,4} {\draw (\x,0.15) -- (\x,-0.15); \node[below,font=\scriptsize] at (\x,-0.15) {$\x$};}
\foreach \y in {-5,...,-1} {\draw (0.15,\y) -- (-0.15,\y); \node[left,font=\scriptsize] at (-0.15,\y) {$\y$};}
\foreach \y in {1,2} {\draw (0.15,\y) -- (-0.15,\y); \node[left,font=\scriptsize] at (-0.15,\y) {$\y$};}
\node[below left,font=\scriptsize] at (0,0) {$0$};
\draw[thick,-{Stealth}] (3,-4) -- (2,-3) -- (-1,-2) -- (-6,-1);
\fill (3,-4) circle (3pt);
\fill (2,-3) circle (2pt);
\fill (-1,-2) circle (2pt);
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
Which function is shown in the graph?
